{"id": "85841", "name": "Cubic spline", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<p>Consider the real function</p>\n<p>\\[ f(x) :=\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{ll} {{CT:0}} &amp; \\mbox{for } x\\leq {{CT:1}}, \\\\ p(x) &amp; \\mbox{for } {{CT:1}} &lt; x &lt; {{CT:2}}, \\\\ {{CT:3}} &amp; \\mbox{for } {{CT:2}}\\leq x.\\end{array} \\right. \\]</p>\n<p>{{CT:4}}</p>\n<p>Find the cubic polynomial \\(p(x)\\) which makes \\(f(x)\\) continuously differentiable. </p>\n<p>\\(p(x)=\\)[[input:ans1]]</p>\n<div>[[validation:ans1]]</div>", "generalfeedback": "<p>First we need to find the information which \\(p(x)\\) needs to satisfy.  This is</p>\n<p>\\[ p({{CT:1}})={{CT:5}}.\\]</p>\n<p>\\[ p({{CT:2}})={{CT:6}}.\\]</p>\n<p>\\[ p'({{CT:1}})={{CT:7}}.\\]</p>\n<p>\\[ p'({{CT:2}})={{CT:8}}.\\]</p>\n<p>If we define \\(p(x)\\) to be the cubic </p>\n<p>\\[ p(x) = a_3 x^3 + a_2 x^2 + a_1 x + a_0,\\]</p>\n<p>We then set up the matrix equation</p>\n<p>\\[ {{CT:9}} {{CT:10}} = {{CT:11}} \\]</p>\n<p>Solving this gives the coefficients, from which we get the polynomial.</p>\n<p>{{CT:12}}.</p>\n<p>We can view this as {{CT:13}}</p>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:prt1]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p>Correct answer, well done.</p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p>Your answer is partially correct.</p>", "prtincorrect": "<p>Incorrect answer.</p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 30, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "anspt : if (x>x0 and x<x1) then ans1 else 1000;", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "subst(x=x0,ans1)", "tans": "subst(x=x0,f0)", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0.25, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": "<p>Your answer does not satisfy \\({{CT:14}}\\).</p>"}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "subst(x=x1,ans1)", "tans": "subst(x=x1,f1)", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0.25, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "prt1-2-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "prt1-2-F", "feedback": "<p>Your answer does not satisfy \\({{CT:15}}\\).</p>"}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "subst(x=x0,diff(ans1,x))", "tans": "subst(x=x0,diff(f0,x))", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0.25, "nextnode": 3, "answernote": "prt1-3-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": 3, "answernote": "prt1-3-F", "feedback": "<p>Your answer does not satisfy \\(p'({{CT:1}})={{CT:7}}\\).</p>"}}, {"name": 3, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "subst(x=x1,diff(ans1,x))", "tans": "subst(x=x1,diff(f1,x))", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0.25, "nextnode": 4, "answernote": "prt1-4-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": 4, "answernote": "prt1-4-F", "feedback": "<p>Your answer does not satisfy \\(p'({{CT:2}})={{CT:8}}\\).</p>"}}, {"name": 4, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "degree(ans1,x)", "tans": "3", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": 5, "answernote": "prt1-5-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": 5, "answernote": "prt1-5-F", "feedback": "<p>Your answer is not a cubic!</p>"}}, {"name": 5, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "ta", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "sco